Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The model weights published from this repository
(ppocrv6_small_rec_manga_real.onnx, tag ocr-manga-v2) are fine-tuned from the
Apache-2.0 PP-OCRv6-small recogniser released by PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR, and
are distributed under the same licence.

This project's model was trained using the Manga109-s dataset (Aizawa-Yamakata-Matsui Laboratory, The University of Tokyo). Manga109-s images are not redistributed. See models/MODEL_CARD.md for citations.

The onomatopoeia annotations used to build the training crops come from COO
(Comic Onomatopoeia Dataset for Recognizing Arbitrary or Truncated Texts,
Baek et al., ECCV 2022), which is licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0). COO onomatopoeia annotations
(Baek et al., ECCV 2022) are CC BY 4.0.

Synthetic training images were rendered from SIL Open Font License fonts and
a corpus derived from Japanese Wikipedia (CC BY-SA); neither the fonts nor the
rendered images are redistributed here.

No manga page images, crops, dataset archives or training checkpoints are
included in this repository or in its release artifacts.
